  "notes": "Expectations are an independent Python re-implementation of the documented algorithm: the seeded java.util.Random stream (nextInt draws, Fisher-Yates shuffle), the percentile interval with linear interpolation, the add-one permutation p-value, and the sample standard deviation. The perfect-line correlation is exactly 1 for every resample, so se/bias/interval collapse to 0/1."
